After some prodding by Catherine, I went digging around in the depths
of my hard drive to find Jimpe. Here it is:
http://web.mit.edu/rspeer/www/research/jimpe.tar.gz

Now, I have to point out that this code has not been well maintained
(we stopped developing it in 2004 when we had to focus on research
that people were actually interested in). It depends on versions of
Rats! and NLTK that are probably ancient, but I've included those
versions in the package.

-- Rob


